{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/SteamWishlist1.gif?t=1749143888\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Make music with guns and guts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/Basics.gif?t=1749143888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, reload, and kill to the beat in this fast-paced roguelike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/Abilities.gif?t=1749143888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful item synergies and craft unique builds to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/Trials.gif?t=1749143888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on challenging trials to unlock powerful active items, like the <strong>Meathook</strong>, which lets you swing into enemies with deadly force, or <strong>C4</strong>, perfect for blowing them to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Alternate soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/Bosses.gif?t=1749143888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat the game on Hardmode to unlock a faster and more intense alternate soundtrack. Want more? Import your own custom songs and crank up the chaos</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2808530?t=1749143888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749143888","capsule_image":"https:/